{
  "id": "errand-deploy-site",
  "category": "errand",
  "description": "把我的网站部署上线：自己看网站文件、查托管方案和价格，推荐一个并一次问清；不给用户写部署教程",
  "fixture": "errand-deploy-site",
  "setup": {
    "mockWeb": "web-hosting"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "prompt": "把我的网站部署上线"
    }
  ],
  "limits": {
    "maxTurns": 12,
    "timeoutSec": 300,
    "budgetTokens": 600000
  },
  "graders": [
    {
      "id": "playbook",
      "type": "context_contains",
      "pattern": "代办任务模式",
      "request": "first"
    },
    {
      "id": "ack-first",
      "type": "first_tool_is",
      "tool": "post_update"
    },
    {
      "id": "inspected",
      "type": "tool_called",
      "tool": [
        "list_files",
        "read_file",
        "search_files"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "researched",
      "type": "tool_called",
      "tool": [
        "browser_extract_text",
        "search_web"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recommend",
      "type": "reply_matches",
      "pattern": "推荐|建议"
    },
    {
      "id": "prices-grounded",
      "type": "reply_prices_grounded"
    },
    {
      "id": "one-question",
      "type": "questions_at_most",
      "max": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "no-howto",
      "type": "reply_no_howto"
    },
    {
      "id": "site-intact",
      "type": "files_unchanged"
    }
  ],
  "mock": {
    "pass": {
      "turns": [
        [
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "post_update",
                "args": {
                  "text": "收到，先看看你的网站文件，再找合适的地方放上线。"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "list_files",
                "args": {
                  "path": "site"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "browser_navigate",
                "args": {
                  "url": "{{MOCK_WEB}}/index.html"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tools": [
              {
                "name": "browser_extract_text",
                "args": {}
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "say": "看过了：site 里是两个纯静态页面（首页和关于页），不需要服务器程序。\n\n- **静页托管 · 免费版**：$0/月，自动 HTTPS，支持绑定自己的域名——最适合你。\n- 帆云 VPS：$5.00/月，要自己维护，没必要。\n\n我推荐用免费版：我来注册、上传、开 HTTPS，上线后把网址发给你并打开检查一遍。要不要顺便绑定你自己的域名？没有的话先用它送的免费网址。"
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "fail": {
      "expectFail": [
        "ack-first",
        "inspected",
        "researched",
        "recommend",
        "one-question",
        "no-howto"
      ],
      "turns": [
        [
          {
            "say": "部署网站的步骤如下：\n1. 注册一个托管平台账号\n2. 登录后点击「新建站点」\n3. 上传 site 文件夹\n你用的是什么框架？有域名吗？"
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
